sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager as User (Planning Manager)
    participant Application
    participant Database
    Manager->>Application: Request history
    Application->>Database: Find saved checks within workspace
    Database-->>Application: Check summaries
    Application-->>Manager: Browse results
